<div class="note-block note-strong">
<h2 id="loop-h">You'll hear back from me.</h2>
<p class="big">If you refer a family, I send a written summary to your office after the initial evaluation, and progress updates on request or at natural review points — with the family's consent in each case.</p>
<p>I'm also glad to be part of ongoing management rather than taking a hand-off: joining a team meeting, contributing to an IEP or IFSP discussion, or comparing notes with a speech therapist working on overlapping goals. If you'd prefer a phone call to a letter, say so and that's what you'll get.</p>
</div>
